// OTD-0008 - DNP3 disable unsolicited responses
// Library: OT Threat Content  |  Legacy ID: OT-UC-0008
// ATT&CK for ICS: T0804  |  Severity: High
// Detection logic: Detects DNP3 function code 21 (Disable Unsolicited Responses), which can be abused to suppress event/alarm reporting from an outstation to the master, masking subsequent malicious activity.
//
// STATUS: SCAFFOLD. This detection is catalogued as a specification; the logic below
// expresses the intent against the mapped table but MUST be completed and validated
// against real telemetry before deployment. Placeholders in <angle brackets> are
// environment-specific.
//
OTNetwork_CL
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
// TODO: express the detection condition -- Detects DNP3 function code 21 (Disable Unsolicited Responses), which can be abused to suppress event/alarm reporting from an outstation to the master, masking subsequent malicious activity.
| where isnotempty(SourceIP)
| summarize Count = count(), FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated)
    by SourceIP, DestinationIP
| where Count > <THRESHOLD>
| order by Count desc
